  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ScaleBoxHelper is a low-level rendering utility responsible for managing and drawing a standardized 3D bounding box visualization within the scene editor. It initializes by creating and buffering vertex and index data for a centered cube geometry using WebGL2. The public draw method utilizes a provided Shader object to render the pre-loaded geometry, interacting directly with the WebGL context to execute draw calls."
